{
  "title": "The Supplication of Friday",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْم\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM. \nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الْاَوَّلِ قَبْلَ الْاِنْشَآءِ وَالْاِحْيَآءِ \nALHAMDO LILLAHIL AWWALE QABLAL INSHAAA-E WAL AHYAAA-E \nAll praise be to Allah, the First before the bringing forth and the giving of life,\nوَالْآخِرِ بَعْدَ فَنَآءِ الْاَشْيَآءِ \nWAL AAKHERE BA’DA FANAAA-IL ASHYAAA-IL \nand the Last after the annihilation of all things,\nالْعَلِيْمِ الَّذِىْ لَا يَنْسٰى مَنْ ذَكَرَهٗ \nA’LEEMIL LAZEE LAA YANSAA MAN ZAKARAHU \nthe All-knowing Who forgets not him who remembers Him,\nوَ لَا يَنْقُصُ مَنْ شَكَرَهٗ \nWA LAA YANQOSO MAN SHAKARAHU \ndecreases not him who thanks Him,\nوَ لَا يَخِيْبُ مَنْ دَعَاهُ \nWA LAA YAKHEEBO MAN DA-A’AHO \ndisappoints not him who supplicates Him,\nوَ لَا يَقْطَعُ رَجَآءَ مَنْ رَجَاهُ \nWA LAA YAQTA-O’ RAJAAA-A MAN RAJAAHO \nand cuts not off the hope of him who hopes in Him!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اُشْهِدُكَ وَ كَفٰى بِكَ شَهِيْدًا \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE USH-HEDOKA WA KAFAA BEKA SHAHEEDAN \nO Allah, I call You to witness and You are sufficient Witness\nوَّ اُشْهِدُ جَمِيْعَ مَلَآئِكَتِكَ \nWA USH-HEDO JAMEE-A’ MALAAA-E-KATEKA \nand I call to witness all Your angels,\nوَ سُكَّانَ سَمٰوَاتِكَ وَ حَمَلَةَ عَرْشِكَ \nWA SUKKAANA SAMAAWAATEKA WA HAMALATA A’RSHEKA \nthe inhabitants of Your heavens, the bearers of Your Throne,\nوَ مَنْ بَعَثْتَ مِنْ اَنْبِيَآئِكَ وَ رُسُلِكَ \nWA MAN BA-A’STA MIN AMBEYAAA-EKA WA ROSOLEKA \nYour prophets and Your messengers whom You have sent out,\nوَ اَنْشَاْتَ مِنْ اَصْنَافِ خَلْقِكَ \nWA ANSHAATA MIN ASNAAFE KHALKEKA \nand the various kinds of creatures You have brought forth,\nاَنِّىْ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ اَنْتَ اللهُ \nANNEE ASH-HADO ANNAKA ANTAL LAAHO \nthat I bear witness that You are Allah;\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA \nthere is no god but You, You alone,\nوَحْدَكَ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَكَ \nWAHDAKA LAA SHAREEKA LAKA \nWho have no associate nor any equal,\nوَ لَا عَدِيْلَ وَ لَا خُلْفَ لِقَوْلِكَ وَ لَا تَبْدِيْلَ \nWA LAA ADEELA WA LAA KHULFA LE-QAWLEKA WA LAA TABDEELA \nand Your word has no failing, nor any change;\nوَ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدً صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهٖ عَبْدُكَ وَ رَسُوْلُكَ \nWA ANNA MOHAMMADAN SALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI WA SALLAMA A’BDOKA WA RASOOLOKA \nand that Muhammad, Allah bless him and his Household, is Your servant and Your messenger; \nاَدّٰى مَا حَمَّلْتَهٗ اِلَى الْعِبَادِ \nADDAA MAA HAMMALTAHU ELAL E’BAADE \nhe delivered to the servants that with which You charged him,\nوَجَاهَدَ فِىْ اللهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ حَقَّ الْجِهَادِ \nWA JAAHADA FILLAAHE HAQQAL JEHAADE \nstruggled for Allah as is His due,\nوَ اَنَّهٗ بَشَّرَ بِمَا هُوَ حَقٌّ مِنَ الثَّوَابِ \nWA ANNAHU BASHSHARA BEMAA HOWA HAQQUN MENAS SAWAAB \ngave the good news of the truth of reward,\nوَ اَنْذَرَ بِمَا هُوَ صِدْقٌ مِنَ الْعِقَابِ \nWA ANZARA BEMAA HOWA SIDQUN MENAL E’QAABE\nand warned of the veracity of punishment.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ ثَبِّتْنِىْ عَلٰى دِيْنِكَ مَا اَحْيَيْتَنِىْ \nALLAAHUMMA SABBITNEE A’LAA DEENEKA MAA AHYAYTANEE \nO Allah, make me firm in Your religion as long as You keep me alive,\nوَ لَا تُزِغْ قَلْبِىْ بَعْدَ اِذْ هَدَيْتَنِىْ \nWA LAA TOZIGH QALBEE BA’DA IZ HADAYTANEE \nmake not my heart swerve after You have guided me,\nوَ هَبْ لِىْ مِنْ لَدُنْكَ رَحْمَةً \nWA HAB LEE MIN LADUNKA RAHMATAN \nand give me mercy from You,\nاِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْوَهَّابُ \nINNAKA ANTAL WAHHAB, \nsurely, You are the All-bestower.\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ عَلٰى آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nSALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nBless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَّاجْعَلْنِىْ مِنْ اَتْبَاعِهٖ وَ شِيْعَتِهٖ \nWAJ A’LNEE MIN AT-BAA-E’HI WA SHEE-A’TEHI \nmake me one of his followers and his partisans,\nوَاحْشُرْنِىْ فِىْ زُمْرَتِهٖ \nWAH SHURNEE FEE ZUMRATEHI \nmuster me in his band,\nوَ وَفِّقْنِىْ لِاَدَآءِ فَرْضِ الْجُمُعَاتِ \nWA WAFFIQNEE LE-ADAAA-E FARZIL JOMO-A’ATE \nand give me the success of accomplishing the obligatory observance of Fridays,\nوَ مَا اَوْجَبْتَ عَلَىَّ فِيْهَا مِنَ الطَّاعَاتِ \nWA MAA AWJABTA A’LAYYA FEEHAA MENAT TAA-A’ATE \nperforming the acts of obedience which You have made incumbent upon me within it,\nوَ قَسَمْتَ لِاَهْلِهَا مِنَ الْعَطَآءِ فِىْ يَوْمِ الْجَزَآءِ \nWA QASAMTA LE AHLEHAA MENAL A’TAAA-E FEE YAWMIL JAZAAA-E \nand receiving the bestowal which You have apportioned for its people on the Day of Recompense!\nاِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْعَزِيْزُ الْحَكِيْمُ.\nINNAKA ANTAL A’ZEEZUL HAKEEM.\nSurely, You are the Almighty, the All-wise!"
}
